  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-copilot-api",
      "text": "[Chinese](README.zh-CN.md)\n\nDeepSeek Harness provider for a copilot-api gateway. Tested with Harness `0.2.1-rc.2`."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-copilot-api\n```\n\nRestart Harness after the first install. The package inserts entry `copilot-api-provider`. No profile configuration is required.\n\nDefaults:\n\n- `baseURL`: `http://localhost:4141` (with or without `/v1`)\n- `protocol`: `openai-responses`\n- credential reference: `GITHUB_COPILOT_API_KEY`\n\nStore the key in Harness credentials or as a launch environment variable of that name. Configuration stores the reference name, not the key."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "Use `anthropic-messages` as `protocol` for Messages."
    },
    {
      "section": "Change the connection",
      "text": "Override the inserted entry only when a default is wrong. Keep the id `copilot-api-provider`, and restate every connection field you still need:\n\n```yaml\n- id: copilot-api-provider\n  config:\n    baseURL: http://localhost:4141\n    apiKey: GITHUB_COPILOT_API_KEY"
    },
    {
      "section": "Change the connection",
      "text": "`apiKey` is a credential reference. `apiKeyEnv` is the same kind of name; when both are set, they must match. `headers` can be set to custom request headers. `modelRefreshInterval` is in milliseconds and defaults to `120000` (automatic refresh every 2 minutes); set it to `0` to disable periodic refresh."
    },
    {
      "section": "From a checkout",
      "text": "```sh\ncd /absolute/path/dsh-copilot-api\nbun install\nbun run build\ndsh plugin --profile web add /absolute/path/dsh-copilot-api\n\nModel mapping and overrides: [docs/models.md](docs/models.md). Headers and sessions: [docs/headers.md](docs/headers.md). Development: [docs/development.md](docs/development.md)."
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-copilot-api",
      "text": "[English](README.md)\n\nDeepSeek Harness 的 copilot-api 网关插件。验证版本为 Harness `0.2.1-rc.2`。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-copilot-api\n```\n\n首次安装后重启 Harness。插件会插入条目 `copilot-api-provider`，profile 里不用再加配置。\n\n默认值：\n\n- `baseURL`：`http://localhost:4141`（可以带 `/v1`，也可以不带）\n- `protocol`：`openai-responses`\n- 凭据引用：`GITHUB_COPILOT_API_KEY`\n\n把密钥写入 Harness 凭据，或设为同名启动环境变量。配置里只填引用名，不填密钥明文。\n\n使用 Messages 时，把 `protocol` 改为 `anthropic-messages`。"
    },
    {
      "section": "修改连接",
      "text": "只有默认值不合适时才覆盖这个条目。保留 ID `copilot-api-provider`，并写上仍然需要的全部连接字段：\n\n```yaml\n- id: copilot-api-provider\n  config:\n    baseURL: http://localhost:4141\n    apiKey: GITHUB_COPILOT_API_KEY\n\n`apiKey` 是凭据引用名。`apiKeyEnv` 也是引用名；两者同时填写时必须相同。`headers` 可以填写自定义请求头。`modelRefreshInterval` 单位是毫秒，默认 `120000` 表示每 2 分钟自动刷新；设为 `0` 可关闭定时刷新。"
    },
    {
      "section": "从源码安装",
      "text": "```sh\ncd /absolute/path/dsh-copilot-api\nbun install\nbun run build\ndsh plugin --profile web add /absolute/path/dsh-copilot-api\n\n模型映射与覆盖见 [docs/zh-CN/models.md](docs/zh-CN/models.md)。Header 与会话见 [docs/zh-CN/headers.md](docs/zh-CN/headers.md)。开发说明见 [docs/zh-CN/development.md](docs/zh-CN/development.md)。"
    }
  ],
